unsubscribeOneClick:
Shu sends one one-click request (RFC 8058) to:
{destination}
The list's server handles it; nothing else leaves this device.

unsubscribeEmail:
Shu sends an unsubscribe email from this account to:
{destination}
No other message is sent.

unsubscribePage:
Shu opens the list's page in your browser:
{destination}
Nothing is sent until you act on that page.
